  "description": "Allen Bradley and Omron provider for MgSoftDev.IndustrialController, built on the open source libplctag driver over EtherNet/IP (port 44818). Supports ControlLogix, CompactLogix, PLC-5, SLC 500, Micro800, MicroLogix and Omron NJ/NX. This is the recommended provider for .NET 7+ - it needs no commercial license. Note: its runtime namespace is IndustrialController.AllenBradley.LibPlcTagNetCore, without the MgSoftDev prefix.",
